[{"id":"MjU-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika a bilangan real, maka&nbsp;<img title=\"\\sqrt{a^{2}}=\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\sqrt{a^{2}}=\" /></p>","choices":["-|a|","-a","&nbsp;<img title=\"\\pm a\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\pm&amp;space;a\" />","a","|a|"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyMw"},{"id":"MjU-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\">Banyaknya faktor positif dari 5! adalah</p>","choices":["4","5","16","24","120"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyNg"},{"id":"MjU-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Banyaknya susunan huruf B, I, O, L, A sehingga tidak ada dua huruf hidup (vowel) yang berturutan adalah</p>","choices":["8","10","12","14","16</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 5.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 32.9pt;\">&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyNw"},{"id":"MjU-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Lingkaran T merupakan lingkaran luar bagi segitiga ABC dan lingkaran dalam bagi segitiga PQR. Jika ABC dan PQR keduanya segitiga samasisi, maka rasio keliling ∆ABC terhadap keliling ∆PQR adalah</p>","choices":["<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{1}{6}\" />","<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{1}{2}\" />","2","4"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyOA"},{"id":"MjU-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Jumlah empat bilangan asli berturutan senantiasa habis dibagi p. Maka nilai p terbesar adalah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">A.1</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">B.2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">C.4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">D.5</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">E.7</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyOQ"},{"id":"MjU-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top: 2.8pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 32.9pt;\">Banyaknya himpunan X yang memenuhi {1, 2} <img title=\"\\subseteq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\subseteq\" /><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS';\">&nbsp;</span>X&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS';\"><img style=\"font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\" title=\"\\subseteq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\subseteq\" />&nbsp; </span>{1, 2, 3, 4, 5} adalah</p>","choices":["3","4","8","16","32"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAzMA"},{"id":"MjU-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Segitiga ABC sama kaki, yaitu AB = AC, dan memiliki keliling 32. Jika panjang garis tinggi dari&nbsp; A adalah 8, maka panjang AC adalah</p>","choices":["<img title=\"9\\tfrac{1}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;9\\tfrac{1}{3}\" />","10","<img title=\"10\\tfrac{2}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;10\\tfrac{2}{3}\" />","<img title=\"11\\tfrac{1}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;11\\tfrac{1}{3}\" />","12"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAzMQ"},{"id":"MjU-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika f(x) =&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{x+1}{x-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{x+1}{x-1}\" />&nbsp;maka untuk&nbsp;<img title=\"X^{2} \\neq 1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?X^{2}&amp;space;\\neq&amp;space;1\" />&nbsp;f(-x)</p>","choices":["<img title=\"\\frac{1}{f(-x)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{1}{f(-x)}\" />","<img title=\"-f(-x)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;-f(-x)\" />","<img title=\"-f(x)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;-f(x)\" />","<img title=\"f(x)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;f(x)\" />","<img title=\"\\frac{1}{f(x)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{1}{f(x)}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAzMg"},{"id":"MjU-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada trapezium ABCD, sisi AB sejajar sisi DC dan rasio luas segitiga ABC terhadap luas segitiga ACD adalah 1/3. Jika E dan F berturut-turut adalah titik tengah BC dan DA, maka rasio luas ABEF terhadap luas EFDC adalah</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{3}{5}\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;1\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{5}{3}\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;3\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAzMw"},{"id":"MjU-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top: .9pt; line-height: 22.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 32.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]-->Diketahui bahwa a, b, c dan d adalah bilangan-bilangan asli yang memenuhi&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{a}{b}&lt;\\frac{c}{d}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{a}{b}&lt;\\frac{c}{d}\" />&nbsp;dan <img title=\"c&lt;a\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;c&lt;a\" />.Jika&nbsp;b <img title=\"\\neq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\neq\" />&nbsp;1 dan c&nbsp;<img title=\"\\neq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\neq\" />&nbsp;d, maka</p>","choices":["<img title=\"\\frac{a}{c}&lt;\\frac{b - a}{d - c}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{a}{c}&lt;\\frac{b&amp;space;-&amp;space;a}{d&amp;space;-&amp;space;c}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{b - a}{d - c} &lt; \\frac{a}{c}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{b&amp;space;-&amp;space;a}{d&amp;space;-&amp;space;c}&amp;space;&lt;&amp;space;\\frac{a}{c}\" />&nbsp;","<img title=\"\\frac{a}{c}&lt;\\frac{b(d-1)}{d(b-1)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{a}{c}&lt;\\frac{b(d-1)}{d(b-1)}\" />","<img title=\"\\frac{b(d-1)}{d(b-1)}&lt;\\frac{a}{c}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{b(d-1)}{d(b-1)}&lt;\\frac{a}{c}\" />","<img title=\"\\frac{a +b}{c+d}&lt;\\frac{a}{c}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{a&amp;space;+b}{c+d}&lt;\\frac{a}{c}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAzNg"},{"id":"MjU-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 5.85pt; text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 32.9pt;\">Suatu pertujukan dihadiri oleh sejumlah penonton. Setiap penonton dewasa membayar tiket seharga 40 ribu rupiah, sedangkan setiap penonton anak-anak membayar tiket 15 ribu rupiah. Jika jumlah uang penjualan tiket adalah 5 juta rupiah, dan banyaknya penonton dewasa&nbsp; adalah 40 % dari seluruh penonton, maka banyaknya penonton anak-anak adalah&nbsp;..........</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0NA"},{"id":"MjU-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\">Diketahui FPB (a, 2008) = 251. Jika a &gt; 2008 maka nilai terkecil yang mungkin bagi a adalah....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0Nw"},{"id":"MjU-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 5.9pt; text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 32.9pt;\">Setiap dung adalah ding. Ada lima ding yang juga dong. Tidak ada dung yang dong. Jika banyaknya ding adalah 15, dan tiga di antaranya tidak dung dan tidak dong, maka banyaknya dung adalah....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA0OQ"},{"id":"MjU-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\">Dua buah dadu identik (sama persis) dilemparkan bersamaan. Angka yang muncul adalah a dan&nbsp;b. Peluang a dan b terletak pada sisi-sisi yang bertolak belakang (di dadu yang sama) adalah<span style=\"font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> ......</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA1Mg"},{"id":"MjU-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan 4-angka dibentuk dari 1, 4, 7 dan 8 dimana masing-masing angka digunakan tepat&nbsp; satu kali. Jika semua bilangan 4-angka yang diperoleh dengan cara ini dijumlahkan, maka jumlah ini mempunyai angka satuan&nbsp;............</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA1NQ"},{"id":"MjU-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 6.0pt; text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 32.9pt;\">Titik A dan B terletak pada parabola <img title=\"y = 4 + x -x ^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;y&amp;space;=&amp;space;4&amp;space;+&amp;space;x&amp;space;-x&amp;space;^{2}\" />. Jika titik asal O merupakan titik tengah&nbsp; ruas garis AB, maka panjang AB adalah....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA1Nw"},{"id":"MjU-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 5.9pt; text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 32.9pt;\">Jika a dan b adalah bilangan-bilangan bulat dan&nbsp;<img title=\"x^{2}-x-1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;x^{2}-x-1\" />&nbsp;merupakan faktor dari&nbsp;<img title=\"ax^{3}+bx^{2}+1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;ax^{3}+bx^{2}+1\" />, maka b =......</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2Mg"},{"id":"MjU-q18","number":18,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Kubus ABCDEFGH dipotong oleh bidang yang melalui diagonal HF, membentuk sudut <img title=\"30^{o}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;30^{o}\" /></span><span style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; position: relative; top: -5.0pt; mso-text-raise: 5.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">terhadap diagonal EG dan memotong rusuk AE di P. Jika panjang rusuk kubus adalah 1 satuan, maka panjang ruas AP adalah<span style=\"letter-spacing: -1.0pt;\">&nbsp;........</span></span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NA"},{"id":"MjU-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Himpunan semua biangan asli yang sama dengan enam kali jumlah angka-angkanya<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.333333px;\">&nbsp;adalah ........</span></span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2OQ"},{"id":"MjU-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui bahwa a dan b adalah besar dua sudut pada sebuah segitiga.&nbsp;jika Sin a + sin b=&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}\" />dan cos a + cos b =<img title=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\inline&amp;space;\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{6}\" />&nbsp;,maka sin (a+b)=<span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.45pt;\">.......</span></span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA3Mw"}]
